  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributions to OECD DAC &amp; WG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to support the OECD (Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development) Development Assistance Committee (DAC), Development Centre, and associated working groups and networks.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funds the central functions of the OECD DAC including peer learning, policy analysis and review. It also supports working groups and networks which inform good practice and policy development, as well as the Development Centre of the OECD. This investment helps to ensure that Irish policies and practise can influence global development cooperation to deliver quality development assistance in an effective way.</narrative>
  </description>
